# backslash-text-comment: What does XPPAUT 8.2.2 do with a comment after a backslash?
# xpp: v@3=3
# pc: ODE0075
# ruling: the comment is dropped with the rest of the line and the next line is joined, as for any other text; PhaseCont warns and calls the text a comment (language.md, Lines).
x'=1+\ # five
2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
